{"id":"neecf3d7233","headline":"U.S. And Iran Set To Meet Tuesday In Qatar For Talks","summary":"The US and Iran have paused attacks after a tense weekend, with talks set for Tuesday in Qatar. The focus is the Strait of Hormuz and rising oil prices.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz carries a large share of seaborne oil, so any disruption there moves global crude prices and energy-linked equities.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Doha","country":"Qatar","lat":25.29,"lon":51.53,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Vero Patriot","url":"https://veropatriot.iheart.com/content/2026-06-29-us-and-iran-set-to-meet-tuesday-in-qatar-for-talks/"},"sources":[{"name":"Vero Patriot","url":"https://veropatriot.iheart.com/content/2026-06-29-us-and-iran-set-to-meet-tuesday-in-qatar-for-talks/"}],"published_at":"2026-06-29T10:40:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"6b98953d661b74f1","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Talks on the Strait of Hormuz and a pause in attacks are the input facts behind expectations of easing supply risk.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-29T10:40:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-29T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"QA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-1584098.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"12019","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/port-arthur-texas-night-evening-1584098/"}}